     * Normalizes a URI path so that it always starts with a single leading slash.
     * <p>
     * The original implementation only removed excess leading slashes but never
     * guaranteed that a slash was present. This could cause malformed URIs where
     * the path is interpreted as a host or scheme component. The updated method
