    /**
     * Safely expands entries from the supplied archive into the target directory.
     *
     * <p>This method performs rigorous path validation to prevent path‑traversal attacks.
     * It rejects absolute paths, paths containing {@code ..} components, and normalizes
     * all entry names before resolving them against the target directory. The resolved
